<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">C. Zheng, S. Liu, M. Li, X. Chen, B. Yu, C. Gao, K. Dang, Y. Liu, R. Men, A. Yang, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span>
</span>
