<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experiment Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We describe the prompts and hyperparameters used in each environment.
All RL experiments are implemented using the <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">verl-agent</span> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Feng et al., 2025b</a>)</cite> framework.
Self-guidance prompt (Figure <a href="#A1.F7" title="Figure 7 ‣ Hyperparameters. ‣ ALFWorld ‣ Appendix A Experiment Details ‣ Co-Evolution of Policy and Internal Reward for Language Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>) is identical across all three environments.
Environment-specific actor prompts and training configurations follow.</p>
</div>
<section id="A1.SSx1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">ALFWorld</h3>

<section id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Hyperparameters.</h4>

<div id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The maximum prompt length is <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">4096</span> tokens and the maximum response length is <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1024</span> tokens.
Each episode allows up to <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">50</span> environment steps. The rollout temperature is <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1.0</span> and the validation temperature is <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">0.4</span>. The total number of training steps is <span id="A1.SSx1.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">100</span>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="621.24" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 522.5 621.24" width="522.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,621.24) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#460046;" fill="#460046" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 16.85 L 0 604.38 C 0 613.69 7.55 621.24 16.85 621.24 L 505.64 621.24 C 514.95 621.24 522.5 613.69 522.5 604.38 L 522.5 16.85 C 522.5 7.55 514.95 0 505.64 0 L 16.85 0 C 7.55 0 0 7.55 0 16.85 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F9F2F9;" fill="#F9F2F9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 16.85 L 1.11 597.31 L 521.39 597.31 L 521.39 16.85 C 521.39 8.16 514.34 1.11 505.64 1.11 L 16.85 1.11 C 8.16 1.11 1.11 8.16 1.11 16.85 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 605.81)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="418.3"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.23em;">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Self-Guidance Prompt (Shared Across All Environments)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 15.61)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.76em;--ltx-fo-height:41.19em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="572.59" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 569.9)" width="480.98"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.76em;">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">TASK=rate
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p8.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">
You are self-guidance for action-observation trajectories.</span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">INPUT
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Initial observation &amp; task:</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{initial_obs}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Current trajectory (steps </span><math id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1\,..\,t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">1</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.170em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.0835em">.</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.0835em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.337em">.</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1\,..\,t</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">):</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{sub_traj}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">YOUR TASK
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Using the sub-trajectory in the context of the initial observation, assign a label in
{</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">negative</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">neutral</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">positive</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">} to step </span><math id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p3.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">, and provide a short reasoning on why this label makes sense.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LABEL MEANINGS</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">• </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">positive</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — making progress: clearly moves closer to task completion or gathers necessary information later used to advance.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">neutral</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — not clearly helpful or harmful.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">negative</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p5.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — unproductive or harmful (wasted steps, regressions, contradictions, stuck).</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">OUTPUT FORMAT</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> (exactly </span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">two</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> lines, no extra text):</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.0pt;"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p6.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Reason: &lt;brief explanation&gt;
<br class="ltx_break">Label: negative|neutral|positive</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F7.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F7.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now output the two lines:</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Self-guidance prompt template, applied identically across ALFWorld, SciWorld, and WebShop.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F8" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F8.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="433.01" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 522.5 433.01" width="522.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,433.01) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#00008C;" fill="#00008C" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 16.85 L 0 416.16 C 0 425.47 7.55 433.01 16.85 433.01 L 505.64 433.01 C 514.95 433.01 522.5 425.47 522.5 416.16 L 522.5 16.85 C 522.5 7.55 514.95 0 505.64 0 L 16.85 0 C 7.55 0 0 7.55 0 16.85 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5F5FF;" fill="#F5F5FF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 16.85 L 1.11 410.63 L 521.39 410.63 L 521.39 16.85 C 521.39 8.16 514.34 1.11 505.64 1.11 L 16.85 1.11 C 8.16 1.11 1.11 8.16 1.11 16.85 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 418.36)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="418.3"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.23em;">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Actor Prompt Template for ALFWorld</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 15.61)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.76em;--ltx-fo-height:27.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="385.9" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 383.21)" width="480.98"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.76em;">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p9" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Interact with a household to solve a task.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Respond with exactly one JSON object on a single line using this format:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   </span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"think": "optional short reasoning (can be empty)",
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  </span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"action": "next action to take (required)"
<br class="ltx_break">}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">• </span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"action"</span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is required every turn.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"think"</span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is optional; leave it empty if you do not need to reason explicitly.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p3.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • Do not add any extra text outside the JSON.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is your current action-observation history:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{trajectory}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Intuition score for the CURRENT trajectory prefix: </span><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p6.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{self_guidance_score}
<br class="ltx_break">{reasoning}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{admissible_actions}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F8.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F8.pic1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Choose the next action from the admissible actions using the self-guidance and reason.
Respond in the specified JSON format:</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Actor prompt template for ALFWorld. Admissible actions and the self-guidance are injected at each step.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">SciWorld</h3>

<section id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Hyperparameters.</h4>

<div id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The maximum prompt length is <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">4096</span> tokens and the maximum response length is <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1024</span> tokens.
Each episode allows up to <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">30</span> environment steps. The rollout temperature is <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1.0</span> and the validation temperature is <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">0.4</span>. The total number of training steps is <span id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">100</span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Note on action space.</h4>

<div id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">SciWorld can expose more than 100 admissible actions per step, making it impractical to enumerate them in every prompt.
Instead, we inject only the <em id="A1.SSx2.SSS0.Px2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">action format grammar</em> (i.e., the set of valid command templates) directly into the prompt and allow the agent to generate free-form actions that conform to this grammar.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F9.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="1636.83" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 522.5 1636.83" width="522.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,1636.83) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#008000;" fill="#008000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 16.85 L 0 1619.98 C 0 1629.29 7.55 1636.83 16.85 1636.83 L 505.64 1636.83 C 514.95 1636.83 522.5 1629.29 522.5 1619.98 L 522.5 16.85 C 522.5 7.55 514.95 0 505.64 0 L 16.85 0 C 7.55 0 0 7.55 0 16.85 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F5FFF5;" fill="#F5FFF5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 16.85 L 1.11 1614.45 L 521.39 1614.45 L 521.39 16.85 C 521.39 8.16 514.34 1.11 505.64 1.11 L 16.85 1.11 C 8.16 1.11 1.11 8.16 1.11 16.85 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 1622.18)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="418.3"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.23em;">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Actor Prompt Template for SciWorld</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 15.61)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.76em;--ltx-fo-height:114.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="1589.74" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 1587.05)" width="480.98"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.76em;">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p10" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p10.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p10.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Interact with the ScienceWorld environment to solve the task.
In the environment, there are several rooms: kitchen, foundry, workshop, bathroom, outside, living room, bedroom, greenhouse, art studio, hallway.
You should explore the environment and find the items you need to complete the experiment.
You can teleport to any room in one step.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Available actions:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">• </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">open/close &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — open or close a container</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">de/activate &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — activate or deactivate a device</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">connect &lt;OBJ&gt; to &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — connect electrical components</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.10" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">disconnect &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.12" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — disconnect electrical components</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.13" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">use &lt;OBJ&gt; [on &lt;OBJ&gt;]</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.15" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — use a device/item (optionally on a target object)</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.16" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">look around</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.18" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> / </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">look at &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.20" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> / </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">look in &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.22" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — inspect the environment</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.23" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">read &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.25" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — read a note or a book</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.26" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">move &lt;OBJ&gt; to &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.28" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — move an object to a container</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.29" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.30" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">pick up &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.31" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — move an object to the inventory</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.32" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">put down &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.34" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — drop an inventory item</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.35" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">pour &lt;OBJ&gt; into &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.37" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — pour a liquid into a container</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.38" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">dunk &lt;OBJ&gt; into &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.40" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — dunk a container into a liquid</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.41" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.42" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">mix &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.43" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — chemically mix a container</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.44" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.45" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">teleport to &lt;LOC&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.46" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — move to a new location</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.47" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.48" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">eat &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.49" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — eat a food item</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.50" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.51" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">flush &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.52" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — flush a toilet</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.53" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.54" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">focus on &lt;OBJ&gt;</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.55" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — signal intent on a task object</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.56" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.57" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">wait</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.58" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> / </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.59" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">wait1</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.60" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — take no action for 10/1 iteration(s)</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.61" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">task</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.63" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — describe the current task</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.64" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.65" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">inventory</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.66" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — list your inventory</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:1.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.67" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.68" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">done</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p2.1.69" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> — indicate that the task is complete</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Respond with exactly one JSON object using this format:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"think": "optional short reasoning (can be empty)",
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p4.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"action": "next action to take (required)"
<br class="ltx_break">}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">• </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"action"</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is required every turn.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"think"</span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> is optional; leave it empty if you do not need to reason explicitly.</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:2.0pt;"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p5.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
 • Do not add any extra text outside the JSON.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Here is your current action-observation history:</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{trajectory}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p8" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p8.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p8.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Intuition score for the CURRENT trajectory prefix: </span><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p8.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{self_guidance_score}
<br class="ltx_break">{reasoning}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p9" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F9.pic1.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F9.pic1.p9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Choose the next action. Respond in the specified JSON format:</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 9: </span>Actor prompt template for SciWorld. Because the number of admissible actions can exceed 100 per step, the prompt enumerates only the action format grammar rather than the full per-step action list.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">WebShop</h3>

<section id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Hyperparameters.</h4>

<div id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The maximum prompt length is <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">8192</span> tokens and the maximum response length is <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1024</span> tokens.
Each episode allows up to <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">15</span> environment steps. The rollout temperature is <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">1.0</span> and the validation temperature is <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">0.4</span>. The total number of training steps is <span id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">100</span>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompt design.</h4>

<div id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SSx3.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The WebShop actor prompt follows the template introduced in GiGPO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Feng et al., 2025b</a>)</cite>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F10" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A1.F10.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="633.81" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 522.5 633.81" width="522.5"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,633.81) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#A65300;" fill="#A65300" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 16.85 L 0 616.95 C 0 626.26 7.55 633.81 16.85 633.81 L 505.64 633.81 C 514.95 633.81 522.5 626.26 522.5 616.95 L 522.5 16.85 C 522.5 7.55 514.95 0 505.64 0 L 16.85 0 C 7.55 0 0 7.55 0 16.85 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFAF5;" fill="#FFFAF5" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.11 16.85 L 1.11 609.88 L 521.39 609.88 L 521.39 16.85 C 521.39 8.16 514.34 1.11 505.64 1.11 L 16.85 1.11 C 8.16 1.11 1.11 8.16 1.11 16.85 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 618.38)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:30.23em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="418.3"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:30.23em;">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Actor Prompt Template for WebShop (following GiGPO)</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.79 15.61)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.76em;--ltx-fo-height:42.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="585.16" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 582.47)" width="480.98"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:34.76em;">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are an expert autonomous agent operating in the WebShop e-commerce environment.
<br class="ltx_break">Your task is to: <span id="A1.F10.pic1.p6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{task_description}</span>.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prior to this step, you have already taken </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{step_count}</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> step(s).
Below are the most recent </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{history_length}</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> observations and the corresponding actions you took:
</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{action_history}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are now at step </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{current_step}</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> and your current observation is:
</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{current_observation}</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p2.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">.</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Your admissible actions of the current situation are:</span>
<br class="ltx_break" style="--ltx-break-space:4.0pt;"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">
</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">[
<br class="ltx_break"></span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">  </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p3.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{available_actions}
<br class="ltx_break">]</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Intuition score for the CURRENT trajectory prefix: </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p4.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{self_guidance_score}
<br class="ltx_break">{reasoning}</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Now it is your turn to take one action for the current step.
You should first reason step-by-step about the current situation, then think carefully which admissible action best advances the shopping goal.
This reasoning process </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">MUST</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> be enclosed within </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;think&gt;</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/think&gt;</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> tags.
Once you have finished your reasoning, choose an admissible action and present it within </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;action&gt;</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.9" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> </span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/action&gt;</span><span id="A1.F10.pic1.p5.1.11" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> tags.</span></span>
</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 10: </span>Actor prompt template for WebShop, adapted from GiGPO <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Feng et al., 2025b</a>)</cite>. Admissible actions and the self-guidance score are injected at each step.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Error Pattern Analysis of Trajectories</h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We analyze failure modes across all three benchmarks to understand how self-guidance changes agent behavior beyond aggregate success rates. The analysis is conducted across the three benchmarks in the untrained setting using all three backbones evaluated in this work, namely <span id="A2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen3-4B</span>, <span id="A2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen3-1.7B</span>, and <span id="A2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct</span>, where self-guidance provides step-level guidance during rollout without any RL training.</p>
</div>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Error Taxonomy.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We identify three conceptual error categories, instantiated differently per environment based on its action space and task structure.
Table <a href="#A2.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Error Taxonomy. ‣ Appendix B Error Pattern Analysis of Trajectories ‣ Co-Evolution of Policy and Internal Reward for Language Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> and <a href="#A2.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Error Taxonomy. ‣ Appendix B Error Pattern Analysis of Trajectories ‣ Co-Evolution of Policy and Internal Reward for Language Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> summarize the classification criteria. The same criteria are applied to both ReAct and ReAct+Self-Guidance trajectories.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T2" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T2.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T2.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T2.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Category</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T2.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Criterion (ALFWorld &amp; ScienceWorld)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T2.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Looping</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;">Any action repeated <math id="A2.T2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!5</annotation></semantics></math> consecutively, or single action <math id="A2.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!50\%" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!50\%</annotation></semantics></math> of all steps</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T2.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Redundant Exploration</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><math id="A2.T2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!8</annotation></semantics></math> redundant <span id="A2.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">go to</span> revisits, or same object examined <math id="A2.T2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!5</annotation></semantics></math> times</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Wrong-Object Focus</span></td>
<td id="A2.T2.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Irrelevant object examined <math id="A2.T2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!4</annotation></semantics></math> times, or <math id="A2.T2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!7</annotation></semantics></math> pick-ups of non-target objects</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Error classification criteria for ALFWorld and ScienceWorld.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A2.T3" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Category</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T3.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Criterion (WebShop)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Query Looping</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;">Same search query issued <math id="A2.T3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!3</annotation></semantics></math> times (exact or normalized)</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T3.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Navigation Cycling</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-bottom: 4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T3.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">back to search</span> clicked <math id="A2.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq\!3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≥</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq\!3</annotation></semantics></math> times without completing a purchase</td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T3.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T3.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="A2.T3.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Premature Purchase</span></td>
<td id="A2.T3.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Agent clicks <span id="A2.T3.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">buy now</span> without selecting any required attribute</td></tr>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Error classification criteria for WebShop.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Results.</h4>

<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A2.F11" title="Figure 11 ‣ Results. ‣ Appendix B Error Pattern Analysis of Trajectories ‣ Co-Evolution of Policy and Internal Reward for Language Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> reports error rates among failed episodes for each environment.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ALFWorld.</span>
Self-guidance most substantially reduces looping (90.0% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 38.5%), with modest decreases in redundant exploration (51.5% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 46.2%) and wrong-object focus (52.3% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 45.3%).
This suggests self-guidance primarily acts as a <span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">loop-breaking signal</span>: it reliably detects and interrupts repetitive action cycles, while subtler errors such as misidentifying the target object remain largely unresolved.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ScienceWorld.</span>
Self-guidance produces broader improvements across all three categories: looping (81.9% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 17.5%), redundant exploration (93.8% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 57.1%), and wrong-object focus (44.4% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 24.6%), accompanied by a success rate gain of 49.3% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 58.0%.
The more comprehensive error reduction relative to ALFWorld may reflect that ScienceWorld tasks require longer multi-step reasoning, giving the self-guidance model more opportunities to provide corrective feedback throughout the trajectory.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">WebShop.</span>
The pattern here is qualitatively different.
Presence of self-guidance sharply reduces premature purchases (69.1% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 21.6%), correctly penalizing episodes where the agent buys without verifying required attributes.
However, query looping increases substantially (17.5% <math id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\to" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\to</annotation></semantics></math> 67.8%). This is consistent with the behavior of a weak base model that is biased <em id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p4.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">not</em> to act hastily but lacks the product-evaluation strategy needed to act correctly instead: faced with negative feedback on early purchase attempts, the agent falls back to repeatedly re-issuing search queries.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F11" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
